hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"588","Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with them both) narrated from the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him), he said: ""I saw Ibrahim, Musa, and Isa (peace be upon them): Isa (peace be upon him) was broad and had a wide chest, while Musa (peace be upon him) was tall with a wheat-colored complexion, and he was among the people of the Zutt tribe."" It was asked to him: And what about Ibrahim (peace be upon him)? He (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""He resembles your companion (the Prophet himself, peace and blessings be upon him)."""
"589","Sufyan Thawri narrated with this chain in a similar manner: and said: 'Isa (peace be upon him) was of reddish complexion and of medium height, and said: He (Ibrahim, peace be upon him) resembles your companion, meaning the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him).'"
"590","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with them both) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) saw a man's thigh, so he said to him: ""Cover your thigh, for the thigh of a man is part of his 'awrah (private parts)."""
